# dpe-agent-config: ownership
# Data Engineering owns this repository. Kept first on purpose: CODEOWNERS gives precedence to
# the LAST matching pattern, so any per-directory owners below this line still win for their own
# paths. Add them there rather than editing this block.
#
# `init` also writes a line for the vendored directory at the END of this file, where nothing
# added below -- including another `*` line -- can shadow it. That is what keeps the vendored
# tree reviewable by the team that ships it.
*  @webflow/data-engineering
